OL,3,GNEWSA'Festive toy appeal will keep
OL,4,AAmelia's memory going'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a girl who died after she
OL,7,Freceived more than 350,000 cards on her
OL,8,Feighth birthday from around the world
OL,9,Fhave launched a festive toy appeal in
OL,10,Fher memory.
OL,12,FAmelia Kolpa, from Rowley Regis, West
OL,13,FMidlands, had only hope to break the UK
OL,14,Frecord of 8,000 cards received, but her
OL,15,Fbid went global and was hugely
OL,16,Fsurpassed, in March.
OL,18,FAt the time, Amelia was receiving
OL,19,Fpalliative care for neuroblastoma and
OL,20,Fdied just weeks later, prompting
OL,21,Fhundreds to line the streets for her
OL,22,Ffuneral procession.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
