OL,3,GNEWSA'Festive toy appeal will keep
OL,4,AAmelia's memory going'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer family are now running a toy appeal
OL,7,Ffor children in Birmingham Children's
OL,8,FHospital and Southampton General
OL,9,FHospital, where she underwent
OL,10,Ftreatment.
